{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "dab679a1-6993-8952-b6b4-83aee8054b59",
  "created_at": "2025-12-12T11:33:36-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Margaret Tillinghast",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:31:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:31:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Calling about a manhole cover. It's sunk down in the road, and it rings every time a car goes over it. Loud clank."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:31:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's a good one to report. Whereabouts is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:31:31-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "78 Van Zandt Avenue. Right in front of the house, kind of in the travel lane. Sorry, I'm on speaker, I'm in the store. [pause] Hang on, let me find the, um, the aisle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:31:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:31:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Canned tomatoes. Diced, crushed, whole peeled, no salt added. Sorry. Anyway, cover's maybe two inches below the pavement, one side more than the other."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:31:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two inches, so it's pretty noticeable. Is it a sewer manhole or do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:32:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not sure. Round, iron, has writing on it. Neighbor hit it too. Guy across the street. Said it jolted his whole car, he was pretty annoyed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:32:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, those can be rough on a suspension. Did he report it, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:32:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] Don't think so. He just mentioned it to me. Pasta sauce, jarred, marinara, vodka sauce. Okay, sorry. Still here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:32:32-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're fine. I'll put in a work order for Van Zandt Avenue, number 78, sunken manhole cover. Do you want a call back if the crew needs anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:32:43-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. 401-555-0169."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:32:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0169. And it's Margaret?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:32:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Margaret Tillinghast. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:32:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. I've got it all down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:32:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "How long do repairs usually take? Like this kind of thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:32:58-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a manhole, someone goes out and looks first, usually within a week or two. If it needs a utility crew or a patch, that can stretch longer, especially with the cold. Frozen ground and winter asphalt slow things down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:33:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Couple weeks, maybe more."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:33:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a fair guess. If it gets worse, like the cover shifts or there's a hole around it, call back right away and we'll bump it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:33:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:33:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it, Margaret. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:33:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
